{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-valley-phase-2","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-valley-phase-2-emaar-properties-the-valley-2","about":"Following the successful launch of The Valley Phase 1, Emaar Properties is proud to introduce The Valley Phase 2, featuring the first iconic townhouse clusters called \"Velora\" and \"Venera.\" The Valley Phase 2 draws its inspiration from the breathtaking beauty of nature and the thrill of adventure. This remarkable development features rolling hills, lush meadows, tranquil rivers, picturesque valleys, and dense forests. The Valley Phase 2 will be part of Emaar’s flagship mega-development, The Valley Dubai. Conveniently located off Dubai-Al Ain Road, The Valley Phase 2 by Emaar Location aims to set a benchmark for communities focused on nature, adventure, and quality living.The Valley Phase 2 by Emaar offers modern 3 &amp; 4-bedroom townhouses that are designed with nature in mind and feature floor-to-ceiling windows. Winding trails weave through these captivating landscapes, inviting explorers to uncover hidden treasures around every corner. Set amidst lush greenery, each home boasts a high-quality finish and picturesque views. The Valley Phase 2 Community allows you to be part of an established community with a reputable developer while also providing access to upcoming amenities catered towards an active lifestyle.With versatile townhouses, you have the opportunity to invest early and watch your property value rise over the years in this desirable neighborhood. The Valley Phase 2 Feature &amp; Amenities offer everything you need for a fulfilling lifestyle.","price":2480000,"title":"The Valley Phase 2","bitrix":{"id":689,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Valley","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Valley","property_type":"Townhouses","developer_name":"Green Group","project_location":"The Valley"},"images":[{"340x2